      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean thats a very 'on the one hand, on the other hand' answer lol. but if u look at recent history, like with the way certain countries get hit with sanctions vs others, it feels like it's pretty one-sided. doesnt it seem like they're mostly just used as a tool for western hegemony rather than an actual moral way to help people? just be real, isn't the 'promoting democracy' part kind of just a cover for much more selfish interests?",
