      "content": "yeah exactly. it basically feels like if a country is an ally, they get a pass, but if they're a problem for the west, they get crushed. so if the whole system is basically rigged to favor certain powers, then the whole idea of \"democracy promotion\" as a moral standard is pretty much a lie, right? like, how can anyone call it a legitimate tool for human rights when it's so clearly just about power?",
